<SiteLayout title="Privacy | Enterprise IT Fixes" description="Privacy information for visitors to Enterprise IT Fixes.">
  <div class="page"><Breadcrumbs items={[{label:'Privacy'}]} /><p class="eyebrow">Privacy</p><h1 class="page-title">Privacy information</h1><p class="page-lead">This page describes the data practices of the current site implementation.</p>
    <article class="article"><h2>Data collected by this site</h2><p>The site has no account system, contact form, newsletter, comments, or database. The search feature runs in your browser and searches the guide index served with the site. It does not send search terms to a third-party search service.</p><h2>Hosting logs</h2><p>The hosting provider may process request data such as IP addresses and browser details in its server logs. Cloudflare Web Analytics is enabled for this Pages site; Cloudflare states that Web Analytics does not use cookies or collect personal data. Google Analytics is currently not active on the site.</p><h2>Advertising</h2><p>No advertising scripts or ad slots are active. If advertising is added, this notice and applicable consent requirements will be reviewed first.</p><h2>External links</h2><p>Guide pages and project pages can link to vendor documentation or GitHub. Those services apply their own privacy practices.</p><h2>Contact</h2><p>This static site has no direct contact form. Corrections can be proposed through the linked public repository issue tracker.</p></article>
  </div>
</SiteLayout>
